        "original_id": "b3f56342-7961-56c1-a776-6441a883f1bd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Patrick Bruders, Rex Brown\n- Organizations: Down, Pantera, Kill Devil Hill\n- Roles: Bassists, musician, author\n\nFacts:\n- Rex Robert Brown was born on July 27, 1964, and he is an American musician and author.\n- Rex Brown was the longtime bassist for Pantera from 1982 to 2003.\n- Rex Brown was a member of Down from 2001 to 2011.\n- In early 2011, Patrick Bruders began touring as the live bassist for Down, replacing Rex Brown.\n- After joining Down on tour in early 2011, Patrick Bruders became a permanent member and performed bass for the band live and in the studio.\n- Rex Brown is currently the bassist for Kill Devil Hill.",
